$ beam on the 33 % chord line, ride on RBE2s (u + theta x r) and PLOTELs draw the LE
$ line, the TE line and a chord at every station.  They are not in SET 1, so PHIX is
$ unchanged; frequencies are unchanged (tests/results/test_modal_export.py).
